<center><font class="option" color="#000000"><b>Announcement on the SPOILERS</b></font></center><br>
<font class="content"><div align=justify>Due to <STRONG>a little</STRONG> adverse criticism we received for posting some info about <STRONG>Madonna's upcoming tour, not already spoiled,</STRONG> we decided to publish the next news <STRONG>from tour rehearsals</STRONG>, <STRONG>in the <A href="http://www.madonnavillage.it/modules.php?name=Forums&file=viewforum&f=25" target=_blank>Re-Invention Lounge</A> section of our Message Board <A href="http://www.madonnavillage.it" target=_blank>MadonnaVillage.it</A>.</STRONG><BR><BR><STRONG>Sorry but you need to register to access our forums, even if you are a Drowned Madonna member.</STRONG><BR><BR>After registered you will receive the confirmation e-mail with your password. <STRONG>If don't please contact us. Then login through the box on the left of each page of </STRONG><A href="http://www.madonnavillage.it" target=_blank><STRONG>Madonna Village.it</STRONG></A>.<BR><BR><STRONG>The Drowned Madonna Team</STRONG></div></font></td></tr></table></td></tr></table>
<br><table border="0" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFA8D3" width="100%"><tr><td>
<table border="0" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFA8D3" width="100%"><tr><td>
<table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFA8D3" width="100%"><tr><td align="left">
<font class="storytitle" color="#FFFFFF"><b>Madonna's Re-Invention Giveaway.</b></font>
</td></tr></table></td></tr></table>

<table border="0" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" width="100%"><tr><td>
<a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=20"><img src="images/topics/live.gif" border="0" Alt="Live" align="right" hspace="10" vspace="10"></a>
<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000">A local <STRONG>Miami</STRONG> radio station is giving away tickets to <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG>'s <STRONG>Re-Invention tour</STRONG> in a contest called <STRONG>Diamonds and Divas</STRONG>. Winner also scores tickets to <STRONG>Jessica Simpson</STRONG>'s and <STRONG>Hillary Duffe</STRONG>'s shows plus a <STRONG>$1,000.00 Diamond necklace</STRONG>. <BR><BR>Listeners must listen to the cue song and be the 100th caller to win. <BR><BR><STRONG>Madonna</STRONG>'s <STRONG>Re-Invention Tour</STRONG> comes to <STRONG>South Florida</STRONG> on July 28th, 29th at the <STRONG>Office Depot Center</STRONG> which are sold out plus another two sold out dates at the <STRONG>American Airlines Arena</STRONG> in <STRONG>Miami</STRONG> on August 1st and 2nd. First two dates on each city sold out in minutes which prompted the promoter to add another show. Madonna last played during the <STRONG>Drowned World Tour</STRONG> for two sold out shows after a 13 year absence from <STRONG>South Florida</STRONG>. <BR><BR><STRONG>Keep on bringing info like this to our attention. Thank you!</STRONG>
</font></div>
</td></tr></table>


</td></tr></table>


<table border="0" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFA8D3" width="100%"><tr><td>
<table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFDFEF" width="100%"><tr><td align="center">

<font class="content">Written by <a href="http://www.drownedmadonna.com/index.php">Giampiero</a> on Saturday, June 12 @  W. Europe Daylight Time  [0 reads].</font><br>
<font class="content"">(<a href="modules.php?name=News&amp;file=article&amp;sid=3072">comments?</a> | Score: 0)</font>

