<table border="0" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" width="100%"><tr><td>
<a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=4"><img src="images/topics/TV.gif" border="0" Alt="TV" align="right" hspace="10" vspace="10"></a>
<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000">German TV stations are reporting today the same story the sun has published about <STRONG>MADONNA's collapse after her show</STRONG>. But now German TV program <STRONG>ZDF</STRONG> has added this: <BR><BR><STRONG>MADONNA suffered the collpase not only because the tour is that demanding, but she is suffering from insomnia, holding a very strict diet and doing too much sports and is therefor underweight.</STRONG><BR><BR>Thanks to <STRONG>singysingysingy</STRONG> for bringing this to our attention.
</font></div>
</td></tr></table>


