<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000"><P><STRONG>GertJan</STRONG>, webmaster of <A href="www.madonnafiles.com" target=_blank>madonnafiles</A>&nbsp;has just launched a new <STRONG>Dutch Re-Invention Tour site</STRONG>. Especially made because <STRONG>Madonna is coming to&nbsp;his &nbsp;country (Netherlands) after 14 years!<BR></STRONG>On the page you will find reviews, news, pictures etc etc (text in English or Dutch).<BR>You can reach the Dutch Re-Invention site through <A href="http://www.madonnafiles.com" target=_blank>www.madonnafiles.com</A>.<BR><BR>And there is also a new <STRONG>Dutch Madonna Forum</STRONG> where fans from <STRONG>The Netherlands</STRONG> get together to talk about the Queen! There is also a special forum about the tour. The link to the forum is <A href="http://www.madonnaforum.nl" target=_blank>www.madonnaforum.nl</A>.</P>
<P>We invite you to visit these new exciting web pages! <BR></P>
