<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000"><DIV class=postcolor><STRONG>Mirror UK</STRONG></DIV>
<DIV class=postcolor><STRONG>Jun 10 2004<BR><BR><BR>HOW THE RICH HANG ON TO THEIR WEALTH<BR><BR>By Matt Roper<BR></STRONG><BR><BR>THEIR bank balances may be bulging but, when it comes to spending it, mega-rich celebrities can be a mean bunch.<BR><BR>Victoria Beckham was spotted taking the tram in Manchester to watch husband David lead England against Iceland on Sunday.<BR><BR>It was also revealed that Posh Spice, who recently sent out for cheap Blue Nun wine during a photoshoot, shops at cut-price store Matalan and lists High Street chain Top Shop among her favourite stores.<BR><BR>Here are 20 more rich and famous people who keep a tight grip on their dosh:<BR><BR><BR><B>MADONNA<BR>Pop queen Madonna, worth £80 million, pores over every telephone statement and orders staff at her £2million Kensington home to cough up for calls they've made</B><BR><BR><A href="http://www.mirror.co.uk/news/allnews/page.cfm?objectid=14318578&amp;method=full&amp;siteid=50143" target=_blank><FONT color=#000000>http://www.mirror.co.uk/news/allnews/page....ll&amp;siteid=50143</FONT></A> </DIV><BR>
