<a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=6"><img src="images/topics/magazines.gif" border="0" Alt="Magazines" align="right" hspace="10" vspace="10"></a>
<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000">NYDAILYNEWS:<BR>Will Madonna forsake her husband, director Guy Ritchie, for Martin Scorsese?<BR><BR><BR><B>Scorsese is said to be talking with Her Madgesty about playing Texas Guinan, the star of silent-movie Westerns and fabled New York speakeasy proprietor. Bette Midler, Courtney Love and others have been mentioned for the role of the woman who greeted customers by saying, "Hello, suckers."</B><BR><BR><B>Meanwhile, Madonna has joined Kabbalah enthusiasts Demi Moore and Ashton Kutcher in introducing a line of Kabbalah candles</B>. Harry Slatkin, who's up for two FiFi fragrance awards tonight, is producing the candles, which have names like Evil Eye and Sexual Energy. <BR><BR><BR><B>We hear Madonna will burn them on stage during her Madison Square Garden shows next week</B>. She's also booked a table at Solo, the new rabbinically sanctioned Mediterranean restaurant, because, owner Joey Allaham tells us, "She only eats kosher now."<BR>
</font></div>
</td></tr></table>


